<title>ESTONIA: RAKVERE SAYS LATVIAN DEAL 103 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>RAKVERE SAYS LATVIAN DEAL 103 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rakvere meat factory said on Tuesday in a statement that its acquisition of 67 percent of the shares in Riga meat factory cost 103 million kroons.</p>
<p>Rakvere signed the agreement on May 14.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
